  "description": "Alverina is a smooth and elegant handwritten script font with flowing curves, bold strokes, and a warm modern personality. Designed to feel both luxurious and approachable, Alverina blends contemporary branding aesthetics with natural handwritten charm, making it perfect for logos, packaging, wedding invitations, social media graphics, beauty branding, editorial headlines, product labels, café menus, and stylish typography projects. Its soft connections and expressive letterforms create a premium signature look while remaining highly readable across both large display and smaller text applications.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Alverina is a smooth and elegant handwritten script font with flowing curves, bold strokes, and a warm modern personality. Designed to feel both luxurious and approachable, Alverina blends contemporary branding aesthetics with natural handwritten charm, making it perfect for logos, packaging, wedding invitations, social media graphics, beauty branding, editorial headlines, product labels, café menus, and stylish typography projects. Its soft connections and expressive letterforms create a premium signature look while remaining highly readable across both large display and smaller text applications.</p>",
